Kind: ablation
Issue: #923
Over: 923-widen-tsc-skew.patch
Takes out: the floor -- each processor answers its own reading, so over the widen a thread that moves to a processor with a smaller skew reads a time before one it has already read: musl_test's [25] must count readings that went back
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4
Expect: musl_test: \[25\] WRONG -- .* [1-9][0-9]* of 100000 readings went back

